1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Reading

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,340
Who am I?

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:08,580
Over time I have been changed quite a lot.

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:14,100
I began as a calculating machine in France in 1642.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,860
Although I was young I could simplify difficult sums.

6
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:34,920
After I was programmed by an operator who used cards with holes,

7
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:40,600
I could "think" logically and produce an answer quicker than any person.

8
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:48,680
At that time it was considered a technological revolution and the start of my "artificial intelligence".

9
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:53,500
In 1936 my real father, Alan Turing,

10
00:00:57,320 --> 00:01:02,420
a universal machine to solve any difficult mathematical problem.

11
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:19,480
However, this reality also worried my designers.

12
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:22,880
As time went by, I was made smaller.

13
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:39,040
These changes only became possible as my memory improved.

14
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:46,760
First it was stored in tubes, then on transistors and later on very small chips.

15
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:50,960
As a result I totally changed my shape.

16
00:01:51,770 --> 00:01:55,400
As I have grown older I have also grown smaller.

17
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:00,000
Over time my memory has developed so much that,

18
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:04,560
like an elephant, I never forget anything I have been told!

19
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:09,960
And my memory became so large that even I couldn’t believe it!

20
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:26,160
I was able to share my knowledge with others through the World Wide Web.

21
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:35,180
I have become very important in communication,

22
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:36,800
finance and trade.

23
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:43,220
I have also been put into robots and used to make mobile phones as well as help

24
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:44,800
with medical operations.

25
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:50,280
I have even been put into space rockets and sent to explore the Moon

26
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,240
and Mars.

27
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:56,720
Anyhow, my goal is to provide humans with a life of high quality.

28
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:01,360
I am now truly filled with happiness that I am a devoted friend

29
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,380
and helper of the human race!
